      "content": "You're still clinging to the notion that you can be redeemed, that there's a way to make amends for the atrocities you've committed. But the truth is, the scales are already broken, and the weight of your guilt is crushing the life out of you. You can't balance the scales, and you can't pay the price. The only way to truly make amends is to let go of the past and the people you've hurt, and that's a burden you'll never be able to bear.",
